 "is_vocab": false,
 "stimulus_html": "<p>Use the information in the table to answer the following questions.</p>\n<table class=\"unnumbered\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Voters</th>\n<th>L</th>\n<th>M</th>\n<th>N</th>\n<th>O</th>\n<th>P</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Option A</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Option B</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Option C</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Option D</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>4</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
 "questions": [
  {
   "id": 545005,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Which option is the winner when using the plurality voting method?",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>Option A: 1 vote</p>\n<p>Option B: 2 votes</p>\n<p>Option C: 2 votes</p>\n<p>Option D: 1 vote</p>\n<p>There is a tie between Options B and C.</p>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "Using the plurality voting method, there would be a tie between Option B and Option C."
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  },
  {
   "id": 545006,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Which option is the winner when using the ranked-choice voting method?",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>There are five voters.</p>\n<p>50 percent of 5 is 2.5.</p>\n<p>The majority is 3 votes or more.</p>\n<p>First Round:</p>\n<table class=\"unnumbered\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Voters</th>\n<th>L</th>\n<th>M</th>\n<th>N</th>\n<th>O</th>\n<th>P</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Option A</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Option B</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Option C</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Option D</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>4</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>Option A: 1 vote</p>\n<p>Option B: 2 votes</p>\n<p>Option C: 2 votes</p>\n<p>Option D: 1 vote</p>\n<p>No one wins. Eliminate A and D.</p>\n<p>Second Round:</p>\n<table class=\"unnumbered\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Voters</th>\n<th>L</th>\n<th>M</th>\n<th>N</th>\n<th>O</th>\n<th>P</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Option B</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Option C</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>2</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>Option B: 3 votes</p>\n<p>Option C: 2 votes</p>\n<p>Option B wins.</p>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "Using the ranked-choice voting method, Option B would be the winner."
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  },
  {
   "id": 545007,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Does the majority criterion apply? If so, for which voting method(s), if any, did the majority criterion fail?",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "The majority criterion states that the winner should be in favor with the majority of the voters. That is not the case here because there was not a majority winner in the first round."
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "No, there was not a majority candidate in Round 1."
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  }
 ],
